{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2022-12-15 09:30:00', 'title': 'GEORGIA POWER RANKED #1 BY J.D. POWER FOR RESIDENTIAL CUSTOMER SATISFACTION IN SEGMENT', 'text': 'HIGHEST RANKED FOR PRICE, CORPORATE CITIZENSHIP AND CUSTOMER CARE ATLANTA , DEC. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GEORGIA POWER HAS BEEN RANKED NUMBER ONE FOR RESIDENTIAL CUSTOMER SATISFACTION AMONG LARGE UTILITIES IN THE SOUTH BY J.D. POWER IN ITS 2022 ELECTRIC UTILITY RESIDENTIAL CUSTOMER SATISFACTION STUDYSM.'}